      <div class="card prog">
        <h4>Rhythm Builder</h4>
        <p style="margin:6px 0">12-week guided rhythm design with weekly checkpoints and measurable micro-goals.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
          <div class="small">Weekly accountability and templates</div>
          <div class="price" data-month="175" data-package="1600">$175</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Explore Rhythm</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card prog">
        <h4>Leadership Intensive + VIP Day</h4>
        <p style="margin:6px 0">A hybrid program combining a VIP Day plus 6 weeks of follow-up to secure changes in team and personal routines.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
          <div class="small">In-person or remote VIP Day available</div>
